  "description": "Hoseon has suffered from the war Jang started for far too long, and hope has grown scarce, but pharmacist Do-Ha Shin is determined to save as many lives as he can until the very end. Except, he wasn’t expecting to manifest as an omega at his age, and he wasn’t expecting to wake up surrounded by Hoseon’s army. He can’t remember the face of the alpha who found and brought him here, and he never got his name. Now, saving the lives of these soldiers could mean saving the life of his love.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
